# Logs
logs/

# Media (hosted article images and feed logos)
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: the volume is `/media` at the repository root
# and nothing else. Unanchored, this pattern matches a directory named `media`
# at *any* depth -- which silently swallowed the whole of
# `src/app/media/avatars/[userId]/` (the route handler that serves the volume)
# when it was added. Keep the slash.
/media/
# The retired Django tree's own volume, named explicitly now that the pattern
# above no longer matches it at depth.
/old/media/
staticfiles/

